//
//  Secrets.example.xcconfig
//  VerseByVerse
//
//  Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in real values.
//  Secrets.xcconfig is optionally included by every build configuration;
//  in Xcode Cloud it is generated by ci_scripts/ci_pre_xcodebuild.sh from
//  the APP_API_KEY environment variable.

// Static key sent as X-App-Key to the Bible API. Matches the API's
// APP_API_KEY env var. Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
APP_API_KEY = replace-me
